      "id": "PR_kwDOJ_r-bs6ZDx4B",
      "title": "deployer: reorganize with subpackages",
      "author": "bitwiseguy",
      "number": 1064,
      "body": "This pr restructures the `ops/internal/deployer` package, adding some subpackages for better organization. This is one step towards addressing the issue identified [here](https://github.com/ethereum-optimism/superchain-registry/pull/1058#discussion_r2124910251) where its difficult to add a new state version. Follow-up steps will be to extract more duplicate code from the `state/vX.go` files into the `state.state.go` file. Instead of having a flat `deployer` package, we now have the following dir structure:\r\n```\r\n|_ deployer\r\n   |_ opaque_map\r\n   |_ state\r\n      |_ configs\r\n```",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/superchain-registry",
      "createdAt": "2025-06-04T16:52:02Z",
      "mergedAt": null,
      "additions": 585,
      "deletions": 534
    },
