    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOJ_r-bs7WD4Lh",
      "title": "chore: bump optimism dep to import op-fetcher mipsImpl fix",
      "author": "Wazabie",
      "number": 1210,
      "body": "## Summary\n\nImports [ethereum-optimism/optimism#20347](https://github.com/ethereum-optimism/optimism/pull/20347) (\\\"fix(op-fetcher): guard against zero mipsImpl before calling oracle()\\\") into superchain-registry by bumping the `github.com/ethereum-optimism/optimism` Go dependency.\n\nThat fix resolves the `FetchChainInfo.s.sol` revert that has been failing the `daily-codegen` CircleCI workflow for several weeks against chains with zeroed-out permissioned game implementations (e.g. OP Mainnet `chainId=10`, Base Mainnet `chainId=8453`).\n\nThis is the import step only — does **not** include any regenerated codegen artifacts. Run `just codegen` on top to refresh `chainList.json` / `chainList.toml` / `addresses.json` once this lands.\n\n## Changes\n\n- `ops/go.mod`: `optimism v1.13.4-0.20250605160538-158e990b76a8` → `v1.16.14-0.20260427160136-8ef523c935ba` (the merge commit of optimism#20347)\n- `ops/go.mod` replace: `op-geth` → `v1.101702.1-rc.1` to match optimism's own `go.mod` at that commit\n- `ops/go.mod` + `ops/go.work`: `go` directive `1.23.1` → `1.24.0` (required transitively by the new optimism revision)\n- `mise.toml`: `go 1.23.1` → `1.24.0` to keep CI's mise toolchain in sync with `go.mod`\n- `ops/internal/manage/staging.go`: drop the `dc.CustomGasTokenAddress` branch — the field was removed upstream when CGT support was deprecated; it was the only blocker to building against the new optimism\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `go build ./...` in `ops/` is clean\n- [x] `just codegen --l1-rpc-urls <sepolia>,<mainnet> --superchains=mainnet,sepolia` runs end-to-end with no `FetchChainInfo` reverts (chains 8453 and 10 now process cleanly; previously they reverted)\n- [ ] CI green\n- [ ] Trigger `daily_codegen_dispatch` post-merge to confirm the scheduled workflow recovers\n\n## Follow-ups\n\n- Steven's PR #1200 was filed for the same root cause but pinned to `optimism v1.13.7`, which does **not** include #20347. After this lands, that PR's optimism + mise bumps become redundant; the `golangci-lint 1.61.0 → 1.64.8` change there is the only net-new contribution.",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/superchain-registry",
      "createdAt": "2026-04-27T17:41:46Z",
      "mergedAt": "2026-04-27T18:27:07Z",
      "additions": 130,
      "deletions": 113
